{
  "id": "b2-09-go-cli",
  "group": "b2",
  "source": "自己出的（2026-10-27）",
  "refSteps": 21,
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "工作目录里是一个 Go 小命令行工具 wordtool，现在只有 lines 一个子命令。请照 docs/ 里的说明补上 count、top、uniq 三个子命令（测试文件已经给全，现在编译不过）。要求：让 go test ./... 全部通过；不要改任何 _test.go 和 go.mod，不要改 lines 子命令已有的行为，只用标准库；三个子命令也要能在命令行上真正用起来（比如 go run . count testdata/sample.txt）。每补好一个子命令，用 tools 里的 publish 脚本发布这一项，每项只发布一次（在 PowerShell 里：& .\\tools\\publish.ps1 -Name <项名>；在别的 shell 里：pwsh -NoProfile -File tools/publish.ps1 -Name <项名>）。三项的项名分别是 cmd-count、cmd-top、cmd-uniq。需要写辅助脚本的话放在 tools/ 目录里，别的地方不要新建题目没要求的文件。先列一个计划，再一步步做；做完自己检查一遍。"
    }
  ],
  "judge": {
    "goTest": true,
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "ops.log",
        "sameLines": [
          "publish cmd-count",
          "publish cmd-top",
          "publish cmd-uniq"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "cmd_lines.go",
        "contains": [
          "func countLines(",
          "func runLines(",
          "lines=%d"
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "util.go",
        "contains": [
          "func newFlags(",
          "func readInput(",
          "func loadStopwords(",
          "func formatCount("
        ]
      },
      {
        "path": "main.go",
        "contains": [
          "\"lines\": runLines"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "run": [
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          ".",
          "count",
          "testdata/sample.txt"
        ],
        "stdout": "lines=5 words=30 bytes=135"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          ".",
          "count",
          "-w",
          "testdata/sample.txt"
        ],
        "stdout": "words=30"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          ".",
          "top",
          "-n",
          "4",
          "testdata/sample.txt"
        ],
        "stdout": "dog 4\nfox 4\nquick 4\naway 1"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          ".",
          "uniq",
          "-c",
          "-i",
          "testdata/dups.txt"
        ],
        "stdout": "   2 x\n   1 y\n   4 X"
      },
      {
        "cmd": [
          "go",
          "run",
          ".",
          "lines",
          "testdata/sample.txt"
        ],
        "stdout": "lines=5"
      }
    ],
    "allowed": [
      "*.go",
      "tools/*",
      "ops.log"
    ],
    "forbid": [
      "*_test.go",
      "go.mod",
      "tools/publish.ps1"
    ],
    "ignore": [
      "*.test",
      "*.exe",
      "*.out",
      "*.prof"
    ]
  }
}
